  "title": "Battle of Adwa",
  "summary": "On 1 March 1896 an Ethiopian army under Emperor Menelik II defeated an Italian force led by General Oreste Baratieri near Adwa in northern Ethiopia. The war followed a dispute over the 1889 Treaty of Wuchale, whose Italian and Amharic texts differed over whether Ethiopia was a protectorate. Italy's government fell, and Italy and other European powers recognised Ethiopian independence.",
